WEBVTT

00:27.160 --> 00:30.560
♪Peach blossoms fall,
yesterday's trace fades away♪

00:30.800 --> 00:34.080
♪Ahead lie storms and winds,
our fates like drifting clouds sway♪

00:34.400 --> 00:40.040
♪Alas, I roam through what remains,
fate's grip won't set me free♪

00:41.400 --> 00:44.920
♪If time would spare me
just one breath to stay♪

00:45.520 --> 00:48.920
♪If you could see
the depth of my belief♪

00:49.120 --> 00:55.680
♪Alone I enter the game,
every move made with no regret in me♪

00:56.080 --> 01:00.040
♪Though shackles bind my soul
and chain my form♪

01:00.160 --> 01:03.240
♪I've walked
through life and death before♪

01:03.320 --> 01:10.200
♪I fear not fate's cruel temptations,
I've severed every cause♪

01:10.400 --> 01:14.440
♪In this life our threads entwined,
in love and pain we crossed♪

01:14.600 --> 01:17.480
♪But I'll keep my word
no matter the cost♪

01:17.560 --> 01:19.960
♪Forged in stardust and flame♪

01:20.040 --> 01:25.800
♪I rise with an unyielding frame♪

01:35.120 --> 01:36.960
=The Princess's Gambit=

01:37.040 --> 01:39.440
(Adapted from the novel "Peach Blossoms
Reflecting the River and Mountains")

01:39.520 --> 01:42.000
(by Bai Lu Cheng Shuang)

01:42.160 --> 01:44.920
=Episode 32=

01:47.680 --> 01:51.360
(Qi State Report)

01:52.120 --> 01:53.200
Outrageous.

01:54.000 --> 01:56.000
Floods in the south,
droughts in the northwest.

01:56.520 --> 01:58.120
Yet Wuyin turns a blind eye,

01:58.440 --> 02:00.280
scheming with Empress Lv for power.

02:03.400 --> 02:04.360
At this rate,

02:05.760 --> 02:08.160
Qi will end up just like Beiyuan.

02:11.360 --> 02:11.960
Your Highness.

02:17.720 --> 02:19.000
Is this today's court bulletin?

02:19.280 --> 02:21.400
Yes, it just arrived from the palace.

02:22.000 --> 02:23.800
(Qi State Report)
Something is odd about this.

02:23.880 --> 02:26.440
Why would His Majesty suddenly
go into seclusion for meditation?

02:27.640 --> 02:28.400
Summon Wang Xi.

02:29.040 --> 02:30.280
- Now.
- Yes, Your Highness.

02:35.000 --> 02:36.680
Mu Wuxia, what happened?

02:38.920 --> 02:40.520
Father is being relocated
to Qingxiu Temple

02:40.600 --> 02:41.600
at the hour of Si today.

02:43.640 --> 02:45.520
Is His Majesty retreating
to seek immortality?

02:47.400 --> 02:49.080
Father may dabble in alchemy.

02:49.520 --> 02:51.480
But he never believes
in Daoist nonsense.

02:52.920 --> 02:54.680
Let alone abandon
the court affair like this.

02:55.680 --> 02:57.240
I don't believe he went willingly.

02:57.640 --> 02:58.520
I need to find a way

02:58.600 --> 02:59.480
to see him fast.

02:59.920 --> 03:00.600
Your Highness,

03:01.320 --> 03:03.520
there will surely
be guards watching him.

03:04.600 --> 03:05.880
If we barge in recklessly,

03:05.960 --> 03:07.400
we'll walk straight into a trap.

03:08.920 --> 03:09.760
Then what do we do?

03:11.440 --> 03:12.200
Well,

03:13.600 --> 03:15.280
I've been to Qingxiu Temple before.

03:16.760 --> 03:19.520
There's a hole in the wall
by the corner,

03:20.240 --> 03:22.640
big enough for a person
to crawl through.

03:32.720 --> 03:33.720
Li Dian can just say

03:34.520 --> 03:35.840
it's a dog hole.

03:35.920 --> 03:37.280
Why say it's a hole in the wall?

03:53.120 --> 03:53.720
Let's go.

04:22.280 --> 04:24.120
Your Majesty, please rest a while.

04:29.920 --> 04:30.520
Over here.

04:30.880 --> 04:31.480
Easy.

04:36.880 --> 04:37.480
Prince Wuyin.

04:38.240 --> 04:38.840
Father.

04:44.480 --> 04:45.920
Prince Wuyin, where's the medicine?

04:46.720 --> 04:47.880
Consort Lan, be patient.

04:49.640 --> 04:50.360
Father,

04:51.720 --> 04:53.360
look at you.

04:54.520 --> 04:56.560
Do you still look like the ruler?

04:59.280 --> 05:00.680
If you abdicate

05:01.720 --> 05:04.240
and live out your days here in seclusion

05:04.320 --> 05:05.960
without meddling in the court affairs,

05:07.760 --> 05:09.720
you'll have more medicine
than you could ever use.

05:11.920 --> 05:12.520
Medicine…

05:14.040 --> 05:14.640
Medicine…

05:17.640 --> 05:19.680
If you write the abdication decree,

05:20.320 --> 05:22.880
I'll give it to you right away.

05:25.840 --> 05:27.960
Father, think this through.

05:28.320 --> 05:28.920
In

05:30.440 --> 05:31.640
your dreams!

05:38.640 --> 05:40.560
Then think on it longer.

05:43.760 --> 05:45.280
I have more pressing matters.

05:46.080 --> 05:47.280
I'll visit another day.

05:47.640 --> 05:49.280
Don't go. Don't go.

05:49.640 --> 05:50.360
Stay!

05:50.680 --> 05:51.880
Your Majesty.

05:53.240 --> 05:53.840
Fine.

05:59.520 --> 06:00.920
I will abdicate.

06:05.840 --> 06:06.920
Give me the medicine.

06:08.520 --> 06:09.560
You better keep your word.

06:09.920 --> 06:10.520
I will.

06:16.960 --> 06:17.560
Your Majesty.

06:19.920 --> 06:22.400
Father, now focus on your meditation.

06:29.240 --> 06:30.160
- Let's go.
- All right.

06:30.240 --> 06:31.200
We'll go in from the back.

06:31.280 --> 06:31.880
Go.

06:32.640 --> 06:33.240
Here.

06:36.880 --> 06:37.480
Come.

06:40.920 --> 06:41.520
Who's there?

06:46.680 --> 06:47.760
It's Prince Wuxia.

06:48.280 --> 06:49.000
Wuxia?

06:50.680 --> 06:51.520
Wuxia, come quickly.

06:52.000 --> 06:52.680
Father.

06:53.080 --> 06:53.760
Wuxia.

06:54.600 --> 06:55.320
Father.

06:55.720 --> 06:56.320
Wuxia,

06:56.600 --> 06:57.840
sit down.

06:59.160 --> 06:59.760
Father,

07:01.280 --> 07:02.320
it's my fault

07:03.320 --> 07:04.200
you've suffered.

07:05.400 --> 07:06.400
I'm sorry I'm late.

07:06.640 --> 07:07.600
How could Wuyin do this?

07:07.680 --> 07:09.000
Don't mention that scoundrel.

07:10.120 --> 07:11.360
Listen to me, Wuxia.

07:11.920 --> 07:14.360
Mu Wuyin tried to poison me.

07:14.760 --> 07:16.360
You must get me out of here.

07:17.000 --> 07:17.840
Father, don't worry.

07:18.160 --> 07:19.360
I'll get you out.

07:19.440 --> 07:21.480
Once we're back in the palace,
the imperial physicians

07:21.680 --> 07:23.000
will help you recover.

07:25.840 --> 07:26.440
All right.

07:36.120 --> 07:36.720
Father,

07:41.400 --> 07:42.320
do you trust me?

07:45.520 --> 07:46.240
I

07:47.720 --> 07:48.600
trust you.

07:58.200 --> 08:00.920
Then I need a decree.

08:04.440 --> 08:05.840
You want one too?

08:06.880 --> 08:08.360
I am not after the throne.

08:09.000 --> 08:11.480
I want to use it
to call for reinforcements

08:11.880 --> 08:13.040
from the capital garrison.

08:25.520 --> 08:28.560
(Shunjing Residence)

08:28.680 --> 08:33.440
(Happiness)

08:38.840 --> 08:39.440
Hua,

08:40.360 --> 08:41.960
I brought you a wedding gift.

08:48.680 --> 08:49.760
The abdication decree.

08:49.880 --> 08:50.560
(Imperial Edict)

08:50.640 --> 08:51.560
(Now, in my old age,)

08:51.640 --> 08:53.640
(I pass the throne to Mu Wuyin
by ancient rites.)

08:57.640 --> 08:58.360
Tomorrow,

08:59.600 --> 09:01.280
I'll proclaim this before the court

09:03.080 --> 09:05.040
and the world

09:09.760 --> 09:11.080
to declare you my empress.

09:15.160 --> 09:15.920
Wuyin,

09:16.800 --> 09:18.160
you've finally grown into a man

09:20.480 --> 09:22.360
I can rely on.

09:23.520 --> 09:24.200
Hua,

09:26.480 --> 09:29.080
I'm doing all of this for you.

09:37.160 --> 09:39.040
If you offer the empire
as your betrothal gift,

09:40.520 --> 09:42.080
then I'll offer you my life.

09:45.200 --> 09:45.960
Truly?

09:49.160 --> 09:49.840
Wuyin,

09:55.000 --> 09:56.280
I wouldn't lie to you.

10:08.880 --> 10:12.800
Hua, then I'll take you to the palace
to begin our wedding preparations.

10:30.800 --> 10:37.280
(Happiness)

10:47.600 --> 10:48.800
Zaiye, Jiang Taohua.

10:49.240 --> 10:50.840
Qingying, Prince Wuxia.

10:51.480 --> 10:53.200
I said we don't know
if we'll ever meet again.

10:53.280 --> 10:55.640
Here we are once again,
meeting just a few days later.

10:56.080 --> 10:57.480
How did you get back into the city?

10:57.720 --> 10:59.280
They are searching for you everywhere.

11:00.240 --> 11:02.200
The Palace Guard only oversees
the court.

11:02.600 --> 11:04.640
Their authority doesn't extend
to the city gates.

11:05.800 --> 11:07.360
You had us worried for days for nothing.

11:08.960 --> 11:09.560
Oh,

11:10.000 --> 11:11.120
what happened

11:11.480 --> 11:12.600
after Mu Wuyin returned?

11:14.720 --> 11:16.600
He used medicine to control Father.

11:16.880 --> 11:19.640
And Meng Zhongyan now
commands the Palace Guard.

11:20.120 --> 11:21.400
The two of them are in cahoots.

11:23.680 --> 11:26.080
And Wuyin is marrying
Meng Zhenzhen tomorrow.

11:26.680 --> 11:28.480
Why would he marry her?

11:30.240 --> 11:32.880
He locked Father away in Qingxiu Temple,

11:33.200 --> 11:34.880
using meditation as an excuse.

11:35.560 --> 11:36.760
Then he forced Father

11:37.280 --> 11:38.480
to write an abdication decree.

11:40.240 --> 11:41.240
Have you met His Majesty?

11:45.640 --> 11:47.680
Father gave me this military decree.

11:51.240 --> 11:55.200
(Deployment Edict)

11:55.360 --> 11:56.600
But there's no imperial seal.

12:01.800 --> 12:02.640
Since you've returned,

12:02.720 --> 12:04.280
have you heard anything
about Empress Lv?

12:07.160 --> 12:09.480
Only that she
and Mu Wuyin arrived in Qi.

12:12.200 --> 12:14.160
She wouldn't abandon
her power in Beiyuan

12:15.120 --> 12:17.240
just to help Mu Wuyin seize the throne.

12:18.360 --> 12:19.520
There's only one possibility.

12:21.440 --> 12:22.600
She was forced to come.

12:24.240 --> 12:25.080
In that case,

12:25.480 --> 12:26.840
her hiding place may be right

12:27.240 --> 12:28.320
under our noses.

12:29.720 --> 12:31.920
(Shunjing Residence)

12:34.440 --> 12:36.080
(Mu Wuyin knows he failed to kill me.)

12:36.360 --> 12:38.000
(Now with the abdication decree
in hand,)

12:38.440 --> 12:40.040
(he could announce it at any moment.)

12:41.520 --> 12:43.240
(Happiness)
(We search his residence for her)

12:43.720 --> 12:45.440
(and use her to hold Mu Wuyin at bay.)

12:58.280 --> 12:59.320
You've been here before.

12:59.400 --> 13:00.440
Did you ever see shackles?

13:01.680 --> 13:02.480
Not once.

13:04.160 --> 13:05.200
It looks like Empress Lv

13:05.360 --> 13:06.960
was forced to come by Mu Wuyin.

13:07.920 --> 13:09.280
But where could she be now?

13:23.920 --> 13:24.960
It's a marriage contract.

13:30.120 --> 13:32.000
So Mu Wuyin is marrying…

13:33.120 --> 13:33.760
Empress Lv?

13:37.000 --> 13:37.880
The wedding is tomorrow.

13:37.960 --> 13:39.680
That means she must be
in the palace right now.

13:39.760 --> 13:42.440
He actually wants to marry
the Empress of Beiyuan in grand fashion?

13:43.640 --> 13:45.520
He has completely lost his mind.

13:46.800 --> 13:48.400
Qingying, if you don't know,

13:49.280 --> 13:51.360
Mu Wuyin has always been obsessed
with Empress Lv.

13:51.720 --> 13:53.720
He will grant her every request.

13:55.440 --> 13:57.080
Don't tell me he's going

13:57.360 --> 13:58.400
to hand over Qi to her?

13:58.920 --> 13:59.680
It's very likely.

14:01.080 --> 14:02.720
The moment he announces the abdication,

14:03.200 --> 14:04.800
he'll also crown her as the empress.

14:05.720 --> 14:06.640
When the court gathers

14:06.760 --> 14:07.600
for the wedding,

14:08.120 --> 14:10.240
that will be our best chance
to expose him.

14:11.360 --> 14:12.720
But breaking into the main hall

14:13.200 --> 14:14.120
with just a few of us

14:14.880 --> 14:15.800
and the shadow guards,

14:16.320 --> 14:17.240
it won't be enough.

14:23.480 --> 14:24.320
Then we leave at once.

14:24.400 --> 14:26.880
We'll call in help from the garrison
with the deployment edict.

14:27.880 --> 14:29.720
Zaiye, the capital garrison is far.

14:29.840 --> 14:31.000
Can we really make it in time?

14:32.480 --> 14:34.480
The round trip will take
more than twenty hours.

14:34.960 --> 14:35.920
There's no time to lose.

14:36.000 --> 14:36.920
Let's go.

14:38.440 --> 14:39.160
Chancellor,

14:40.040 --> 14:42.480
maybe I can buy you some time.

14:44.600 --> 14:45.960
If Meng Zhenzhen finds out

14:46.560 --> 14:48.960
Mu Wuyin isn't marrying her,

14:49.040 --> 14:50.120
what do you think she'll do?

14:51.280 --> 14:52.520
Are you planning to see her?

14:54.360 --> 14:55.720
But what if she doesn't believe you?

14:55.800 --> 14:57.120
You would be walking into a trap.

15:00.200 --> 15:00.840
Taohua,

15:03.120 --> 15:03.840
don't worry.

15:04.320 --> 15:06.080
I will come back
with reinforcements in time.

15:07.520 --> 15:08.120
All right.

15:09.600 --> 15:10.320
I'll wait for you.

15:15.080 --> 15:15.680
Hyah!

15:16.000 --> 15:16.600
Go!

15:16.680 --> 15:17.640
(Mu Wuyin has some influence)

15:17.720 --> 15:18.800
(in the capital garrison.)

15:19.320 --> 15:20.560
(We'll need to go in disguised)

15:20.840 --> 15:22.480
(to avoid alerting anyone.)

15:23.320 --> 15:25.160
(General Zhou Chonghu commands
the garrison.)

15:25.560 --> 15:26.320
(He is shrewd)

15:26.400 --> 15:27.240
(and opportunistic.)

15:28.480 --> 15:30.960
(With how things stand,
even if he hasn't sided with Mu Wuyin,)

15:31.040 --> 15:33.160
(he's probably waiting to see
who comes out on top.)

15:34.160 --> 15:34.920
(So in this mission,)

15:35.000 --> 15:37.200
(Capital Garrison, Outskirts)
(we must persuade him)

15:37.320 --> 15:38.800
(to take our side.)

15:40.360 --> 15:41.160
Sir, wait.

15:41.520 --> 15:42.680
I'm Prince Wuyin's envoy.

15:42.760 --> 15:44.040
Take me to see General Zhou.

15:44.160 --> 15:44.760
Very well.

15:50.840 --> 15:52.040
(Besides Zhou Chonghu,)

15:52.120 --> 15:54.040
(we also need the support
of his senior officers.)

15:56.040 --> 15:58.760
(Only they can command
the troops directly.)

15:58.840 --> 16:00.000
(If we can awaken their loyalty)

16:00.080 --> 16:01.360
(to defend the throne,)

16:01.440 --> 16:03.320
(we can mobilize
the entire capital garrison.)

16:05.840 --> 16:07.320
It is Prince Wuyin's wedding tomorrow.

16:07.600 --> 16:09.520
We've been sent
to discuss rotation arrangements.

16:10.360 --> 16:11.400
I'll speak to General Zhou.

16:11.960 --> 16:12.720
I want you to gather

16:12.800 --> 16:14.640
all officers ranked lieutenant
and above here.

16:15.600 --> 16:16.200
Yes.

16:17.080 --> 16:17.760
(Prince Wuxia,)

16:18.360 --> 16:19.640
(you will talk to General Zhou.)

16:22.880 --> 16:25.320
(I'll speak to the lower officers.
They once served under me.)

16:25.800 --> 16:26.720
(So leave them to me.)

16:35.960 --> 16:36.800
Officers present!

16:42.800 --> 16:44.760
- Greetings, Chancellor.
- Greetings, Chancellor.

16:48.120 --> 16:49.040
It's been a while.

16:49.160 --> 16:51.480
What ranks are you two holding now?

16:51.560 --> 16:53.720
(Yao Jing. Right Guard General,
Capital Garrison)

16:53.800 --> 16:55.400
General Yao Jing, the Right Guard General.

16:55.520 --> 16:57.320
(Yuan Qin. Infantry Commandant,
Capital Garrison)

16:57.400 --> 16:59.520
General Yuan Qin, the Infantry Commandant.

17:05.440 --> 17:06.839
If I remember correctly,

17:07.480 --> 17:10.240
I promoted you from a foot soldier
to commandant three years ago.

17:11.640 --> 17:12.800
Now three years have passed,

17:12.880 --> 17:15.640
you're still in that same position
and covered in scars.

17:18.000 --> 17:18.920
Forgive me, Chancellor.

17:19.359 --> 17:21.319
I've disappointed you.

17:27.920 --> 17:30.120
I, Zhou Chonghu, greet Your Highness.

17:31.440 --> 17:32.840
(Zhou Chonghu, Garrison Commander)

17:32.920 --> 17:35.840
Prince Wuxia,
what brings you here today?

17:37.320 --> 17:37.960
General Zhou,

17:38.720 --> 17:41.000
Wuyin sent someone here already,
didn't he?

17:41.560 --> 17:42.600
Your Highness sees clearly.

17:43.120 --> 17:44.800
But Prince Wuyin is the crown prince.

17:45.040 --> 17:46.200
Overseeing national security

17:46.880 --> 17:49.520
is his duty.

17:50.200 --> 17:51.480
General Zhou, no need to explain.

17:52.280 --> 17:52.880
I know you.

17:53.560 --> 17:56.240
You've never played factions
or politics.

17:56.760 --> 17:58.240
You only follow Father's orders.

17:59.040 --> 18:01.000
His Majesty gave me my position.

18:01.800 --> 18:04.800
I'll stay loyal to him to the death.

18:05.200 --> 18:05.800
Good.

18:07.680 --> 18:10.080
Then take a look at this.

18:28.080 --> 18:28.720
Your Highness,

18:29.840 --> 18:30.920
forgive me.

18:31.720 --> 18:34.640
But I can't tell
whose handwriting this is.

18:35.640 --> 18:36.640
General Zhou,

18:38.200 --> 18:40.240
are you not acknowledging
Father's decree?

18:40.560 --> 18:41.440
I dare not.

18:43.120 --> 18:44.600
But I'm just a rough man.

18:44.920 --> 18:46.120
I barely read.

18:46.640 --> 18:48.840
Let alone recognize handwriting.

18:49.480 --> 18:52.240
I've always obeyed the seal.

19:20.320 --> 19:21.440
In our military system,

19:21.560 --> 19:23.640
our soldier recruits only come
from three groups.

19:24.480 --> 19:26.560
The commoners, refugees,
and military households.

19:28.040 --> 19:30.480
You've all fought
your way up to command.

19:31.080 --> 19:32.760
But I know you haven't forgotten
your roots.

19:33.280 --> 19:35.440
- We dare not, Chancellor!
- We dare not, Chancellor!

19:36.120 --> 19:37.760
It's not that you wouldn't dare
to forget.

19:38.560 --> 19:39.840
You can't forget.

19:41.600 --> 19:44.640
As you climbed your way up,

19:45.800 --> 19:46.840
how many times

19:47.120 --> 19:48.040
have you faced death?

19:48.920 --> 19:50.600
How many fallen comrades
have you buried?

19:51.560 --> 19:55.120
And those who survived,
aren't they all covered in scars?

19:58.320 --> 19:59.200
But the noble families

20:00.000 --> 20:02.920
who were born into privilege
have never experienced it.

20:03.560 --> 20:04.520
So they will never care.

20:06.800 --> 20:07.520
General Zhou,

20:08.480 --> 20:10.000
you say you're a rough

20:10.520 --> 20:11.680
and uneducated man.

20:12.560 --> 20:14.240
Then let me help you analyze

20:14.880 --> 20:15.840
the risks and the gains.

20:16.680 --> 20:17.880
Mu Wuyin has imprisoned Father,

20:17.960 --> 20:21.120
seized control of the Palace Guard,
and has the throne in his hands.

20:21.840 --> 20:24.040
You have three choices.

20:25.600 --> 20:26.240
First,

20:27.000 --> 20:28.720
if you're thinking of staying neutral,

20:29.160 --> 20:30.600
then whether you're blind to reality

20:30.800 --> 20:34.360
or just looking out for yourself,
you'll end up with nothing in the end.

20:35.840 --> 20:36.800
Second,

20:37.400 --> 20:40.120
you could turn me in
and pledge loyalty to him.

20:41.720 --> 20:43.760
But you have missed out
on the perfect timing.

20:44.440 --> 20:45.040
The Meng family

20:45.120 --> 20:47.320
and General Qi of the Palace Guard sided
with him early.

20:47.720 --> 20:49.200
That's what we call timely support.

20:50.040 --> 20:51.960
Now that he's on the verge
of seizing power,

20:52.880 --> 20:54.320
knowing what he's like,

20:54.960 --> 20:56.080
he'll have no use

20:56.160 --> 20:58.080
for your empty gestures.

21:04.760 --> 21:09.600
Your third option,
if you join me in protecting the throne,

21:10.480 --> 21:11.120
this battle

21:12.200 --> 21:13.400
will make you a hero.

21:28.040 --> 21:29.640
Prince Wuyin is deeply tied

21:30.160 --> 21:31.320
to the noble families.

21:31.760 --> 21:35.000
If he takes the throne,
your children will still have

21:35.720 --> 21:36.960
to risk their lives just

21:37.680 --> 21:38.880
to climb the ranks.

21:39.120 --> 21:41.440
You've all clawed your way
through hardships.

21:41.680 --> 21:43.160
Do you really want to settle for that?

21:48.600 --> 21:49.200
Comrades,

21:50.120 --> 21:52.560
fight with me today
to defend the rightful ruler

21:53.320 --> 21:54.880
and bring justice to the land!

21:55.640 --> 21:56.720
Will you fight with me?

21:58.040 --> 21:58.840
- We will!
- We will!

21:58.920 --> 21:59.760
- We will!
- We will!

22:00.160 --> 22:00.960
- We will!
- We will!

22:01.320 --> 22:02.120
- We will!
- We will!

22:07.560 --> 22:09.760
Your Highness, I'll be honest.

22:10.640 --> 22:12.720
I may command the troops.

22:12.800 --> 22:14.560
But I don't have the authority
to deploy them.

22:15.680 --> 22:17.400
Even if I wanted to help you,

22:18.000 --> 22:19.360
the men might not follow.

22:31.960 --> 22:32.640
General Zhou,

22:33.440 --> 22:35.400
why don't you come with me
to the training grounds?

22:35.840 --> 22:36.680
Yes, Your Highness.

22:45.800 --> 22:47.080
Seeing really is believing.

22:47.240 --> 22:49.520
Chancellor Shen managed
to rally every lower-ranked officer

22:49.600 --> 22:50.880
to rise in defense of the throne.

22:51.760 --> 22:52.720
Impressive.

22:53.560 --> 22:56.560
But I still have one concern.

22:56.640 --> 22:58.040
Please, speak freely, General Zhou.

22:59.240 --> 23:00.920
The troops have been marching all day.

23:01.320 --> 23:02.960
They're tired

23:03.040 --> 23:03.880
and low on morale.

23:04.600 --> 23:06.840
If His Majesty could appear in person,

23:07.440 --> 23:09.680
it would boost their spirits enough

23:09.960 --> 23:10.960
to storm the palace.

23:17.600 --> 23:20.440
So what you're saying is,
you won't lead your men into the palace

23:20.960 --> 23:22.200
if His Majesty doesn't show up?

23:23.280 --> 23:24.600
I need a fallback plan.

23:25.320 --> 23:27.680
I hope you understand, Chancellor.

23:30.920 --> 23:33.680
Very well. As you wish.

23:39.160 --> 23:40.200
Set out to Yujing

23:40.360 --> 23:41.440
to defend the Emperor!

23:41.800 --> 23:48.800
- Protect His Majesty!
- To the Emperor!

23:51.160 --> 23:54.000
(Yujing)

23:57.520 --> 23:58.840
What a grand bridal procession.

23:59.800 --> 24:01.240
Which noble family is it this time?

24:01.320 --> 24:02.400
They say it's the Meng family.

24:02.480 --> 24:03.560
Yes, it's the Meng family.

24:04.400 --> 24:05.200
Your Highness, look.

24:09.680 --> 24:12.200
They're heading to the Meng residence
to pick up the bride.

24:13.600 --> 24:15.000
If Meng Zhenzhen enters the palace,

24:15.280 --> 24:17.320
we might lose our chance
to speak to her.

24:19.520 --> 24:20.920
Let's wait a bit for the Chancellor.

24:36.520 --> 24:37.200
Hua,

24:39.320 --> 24:41.400
you're the most beautiful bride
I've ever seen.

24:51.400 --> 24:53.640
Your Highness,
the ceremony's about to begin.

25:26.080 --> 25:29.840
(Qingxiu Temple)

25:37.160 --> 25:37.760
Medicine…

25:39.360 --> 25:40.040
I need medicine.

25:41.520 --> 25:42.200
Your Majesty.

25:44.840 --> 25:45.440
Your Majesty.

25:49.000 --> 25:51.120
Do you want this?

25:51.200 --> 25:51.800
Your Majesty.

25:51.920 --> 25:53.000
- Medicine…
- Your Majesty.

25:57.360 --> 25:57.960
Medicine…

25:58.040 --> 25:59.600
Look at you now.

26:00.800 --> 26:03.640
Never thought
I'd see you brought this low.

26:04.440 --> 26:05.400
Right Chancellor Meng,

26:05.960 --> 26:08.520
His Majesty has always been good
to your family.

26:08.840 --> 26:11.400
Is this how you repay him?

26:12.000 --> 26:14.280
You have no shame!

26:16.720 --> 26:17.960
Without the Meng family,

26:18.280 --> 26:21.080
how would the Mu Clan have come
to rule over Qi back then?

26:21.920 --> 26:23.320
Do you think I don't know

26:23.680 --> 26:26.880
you've long grown tired
of the noble families?

26:27.760 --> 26:28.960
You elevated Shen Zaiye

26:29.440 --> 26:30.960
as your tool

26:31.040 --> 26:32.640
just to cut us down!

26:33.920 --> 26:35.040
Give me the medicine!

26:42.200 --> 26:43.360
Your Majesty…

26:48.520 --> 26:50.480
You, traitor.

27:05.120 --> 27:06.200
Don't worry, Your Majesty.

27:06.440 --> 27:07.720
Once Prince Wuyin takes the throne

27:07.800 --> 27:09.120
in two hours,

27:09.600 --> 27:11.640
you'll have all the medicine you want.

27:25.280 --> 27:25.880
There he is.

27:26.720 --> 27:27.320
Let's go.

27:29.080 --> 27:29.680
Easy.

27:33.760 --> 27:34.480
How did it go?

27:34.880 --> 27:35.600
The army is here.

27:36.240 --> 27:37.800
But the generals won't march
on the palace

27:37.880 --> 27:39.280
unless they see His Majesty in person.

27:39.360 --> 27:41.120
The Chancellor took a detour
to Qingxiu Temple

27:41.200 --> 27:42.080
to rescue His Majesty.

27:44.520 --> 27:45.520
We're almost out of time.

27:47.320 --> 27:49.720
(I must buy time for him.)

27:57.360 --> 27:58.280
Protect the Emperor!

28:02.840 --> 28:04.560
Stop the traitors! Attack!

28:41.320 --> 28:42.200
Shen Zaiye,

28:45.440 --> 28:46.280
just surrender!

28:49.160 --> 28:50.760
We were family once.

28:51.520 --> 28:53.200
I might even spare your life!

28:57.840 --> 28:58.720
Intruders!

29:04.160 --> 29:05.040
Kill them!

29:25.320 --> 29:26.000
Everyone, stop!

29:32.120 --> 29:32.720
Father.

29:33.960 --> 29:34.600
Father.

29:35.840 --> 29:36.440
Father,

29:37.080 --> 29:37.960
are you all right?

29:39.800 --> 29:40.640
Wuxia.

29:41.280 --> 29:43.600
Father, the capital garrison
is just outside the city.

29:43.680 --> 29:45.720
They're waiting for your command
to storm the palace.

29:46.680 --> 29:47.280
Really?

29:47.480 --> 29:48.080
Yes.

29:48.720 --> 29:50.280
Father, get up.

29:54.600 --> 29:56.400
Father, you and Wang Xi go ahead first.

29:56.480 --> 29:57.840
Chancellor Shen is still out there.

29:57.920 --> 29:58.720
I need to help him.

29:58.880 --> 29:59.480
All right.

30:00.040 --> 30:01.480
Please be careful.

30:02.120 --> 30:03.360
Your Majesty, this way.

30:03.680 --> 30:04.800
- All right.
- Father, go.

30:05.480 --> 30:06.280
Consort Lan, go now.

30:08.680 --> 30:09.800
Slowly now.

30:20.960 --> 30:23.120
Meng Zhongyan, it's over.

30:24.360 --> 30:25.480
You're too late.

30:27.200 --> 30:30.600
Prince Wuyin already has
the abdication decree.

30:31.440 --> 30:33.680
Once he's crowned,

30:34.240 --> 30:37.000
he'll be the rightful ruler of Qi.

30:38.080 --> 30:40.600
The rites were observed.

30:41.000 --> 30:42.320
So his succession is legitimate.

30:43.800 --> 30:45.480
Even His Majesty himself

30:46.000 --> 30:47.400
can't undo it.

30:48.560 --> 30:49.320
Take him away.

30:51.760 --> 30:52.520
- Move it.
- Go.

31:15.840 --> 31:16.640
Let him go.

31:17.240 --> 31:18.040
Let him go first.

31:24.360 --> 31:26.200
If you dare lay a finger
on Prince Wuxia,

31:27.000 --> 31:28.920
I swear you won't even have
a place to rot.

31:30.400 --> 31:31.520
If I can't protect my master,

31:31.760 --> 31:32.720
so what if I die?

31:34.080 --> 31:34.760
Liu Bao,

31:35.880 --> 31:36.960
I know you're loyal.

31:38.120 --> 31:40.240
But Meng Zhongyan has committed treason.

31:40.800 --> 31:42.400
Is this really worth it?

31:42.760 --> 31:44.840
One more step, I swear I'll kill him!

31:53.320 --> 31:53.920
Let him go.

31:58.800 --> 31:59.920
Take me instead.

32:01.640 --> 32:02.440
You?

32:03.240 --> 32:03.920
You're just

32:04.000 --> 32:05.720
a lowborn Chancellor.

32:05.880 --> 32:07.720
Do you think
you're worth the same as a prince?

32:10.560 --> 32:13.400
I'm Prince Wuxia's cousin, Xie Jing'an.

32:19.240 --> 32:20.080
Take me hostage

32:20.440 --> 32:21.680
and you'll still have leverage.

32:30.360 --> 32:31.200
Remember

32:33.120 --> 32:33.880
this handkerchief?

32:33.960 --> 32:36.960
(Xie)

33:00.040 --> 33:00.760
Wuxia,

33:01.160 --> 33:02.040
how is your hand?

33:03.960 --> 33:04.640
Jing'an.

33:12.280 --> 33:13.240
Let me go with you.

33:16.000 --> 33:17.800
No, it's too dangerous.

33:18.440 --> 33:19.640
I can't guarantee your safety.

33:20.240 --> 33:21.200
I'll be fine.

33:22.160 --> 33:22.760
Wuxia,

33:23.280 --> 33:24.560
His Majesty needs you.

33:32.360 --> 33:33.840
The rest, come with me!

33:39.920 --> 33:41.360
(Meng Residence)

34:08.840 --> 34:09.880
I'm not here to hurt you.

34:10.560 --> 34:12.120
I have something important to tell you.

34:12.440 --> 34:13.679
It concerns your life.

34:16.040 --> 34:17.560
If you promise not to scream,

34:18.080 --> 34:18.800
nod.

34:27.000 --> 34:27.719
Jiang Taohua,

34:28.639 --> 34:30.040
you should be hiding right now.

34:30.840 --> 34:32.000
It's foolish

34:32.320 --> 34:33.520
to walk right into your death.

34:34.280 --> 34:35.719
Ever heard the phrase "times change"?

34:36.880 --> 34:38.360
The one about to die isn't me.

34:39.199 --> 34:40.239
I came here

34:40.480 --> 34:41.719
to save you.

34:42.840 --> 34:44.199
You're just trying to scare me.

34:45.639 --> 34:46.520
Do you know

34:46.920 --> 34:48.400
another woman is being prepared

34:49.239 --> 34:50.440
for the wedding

34:50.520 --> 34:51.760
at this moment?

34:52.080 --> 34:52.800
So what?

34:53.719 --> 34:55.840
The Meng family only cares
about the title of empress.

34:56.239 --> 34:57.560
What does the rest of the harem

34:58.160 --> 34:59.040
have to do with me?

34:59.560 --> 35:01.920
That position will go to her.

35:05.240 --> 35:06.520
Prince Wuyin wants the throne.

35:07.280 --> 35:09.080
Why would he sabotage his own plans?

35:09.160 --> 35:10.200
Maybe you're underestimating

35:10.280 --> 35:11.760
how far a man in love can go.

35:13.600 --> 35:15.200
If you enter the palace today,

35:15.520 --> 35:17.080
Mu Wuyin will kill you
to cover his tracks.

35:17.160 --> 35:19.040
He'll swap you out
like nothing ever happened.

35:20.520 --> 35:21.200
Impossible.

35:22.120 --> 35:23.560
Why would he turn on the Meng family?

35:27.840 --> 35:28.800
This marriage contract.

35:29.040 --> 35:30.800
I found it in Mu Wuyin's secret chamber.

35:31.800 --> 35:32.920
The name of the bride

35:33.320 --> 35:34.760
is written on this contract.

35:35.600 --> 35:36.400
Her name is Hua.

35:37.040 --> 35:39.200
(Hua)
She was his personal maid servant.

35:40.320 --> 35:41.600
After his older sister died,

35:42.000 --> 35:43.520
he clung to her like family.

35:44.160 --> 35:45.160
You're free to verify

35:45.320 --> 35:46.600
everything I've said.

35:49.240 --> 35:52.080
But Hua has another identity.

35:53.200 --> 35:54.320
She's Empress Lv of Beiyuan.

35:56.600 --> 35:57.560
If I'm right,

35:58.440 --> 35:59.840
this alliance with your family

35:59.960 --> 36:01.000
was never what he wanted.

36:01.800 --> 36:03.000
To him,

36:03.600 --> 36:05.600
the Meng family isn't a stepping stone.

36:06.160 --> 36:08.280
It's an obstacle he plans to remove.

36:11.320 --> 36:12.120
I don't believe you.

36:13.000 --> 36:14.440
Why are you telling me all this?

36:15.440 --> 36:17.640
Wouldn't it suit you better

36:17.840 --> 36:19.160
to let us tear each other apart?

36:20.440 --> 36:21.240
How about this?

36:21.760 --> 36:22.640
We make a bet.

36:23.240 --> 36:24.240
Let us into the palace.

36:25.000 --> 36:26.360
If Mu Wuyin really makes a move,

36:26.600 --> 36:27.880
Qingtai will protect you.

36:28.400 --> 36:30.560
If none of what I said happens,

36:31.240 --> 36:32.080
then both our lives

36:33.120 --> 36:34.080
are yours to take.

36:41.440 --> 36:43.520
(Hua)

36:45.480 --> 36:48.280
Why is Prince Wuyin's
wedding being held in the palace?

36:48.840 --> 36:51.080
Only the ruler has the right to do that.

36:52.360 --> 36:54.080
His Majesty hasn't shown himself
in a while.

36:54.240 --> 36:56.520
Prince Wuyin holds all the power now.

36:57.480 --> 36:58.280
Isn't he practically

36:58.600 --> 37:00.160
the ruler already?

37:00.920 --> 37:01.680
Mr. Li,

37:02.520 --> 37:03.800
be careful what you say.

37:04.320 --> 37:04.920
Out of the way!

37:05.600 --> 37:06.240
Make way!

37:06.640 --> 37:07.240
Move aside!

37:13.880 --> 37:14.480
This…

37:14.600 --> 37:15.800
Something feels off here.

37:22.640 --> 37:24.760
Today, a noble man blessed

37:24.840 --> 37:26.480
with imperial favor joined in marriage

37:27.000 --> 37:28.440
with a virtuous lady

37:28.760 --> 37:30.400
from a good family.

37:31.120 --> 37:33.760
May their union last a lifetime

37:34.240 --> 37:37.080
and bring lasting harmony.

37:39.360 --> 37:41.760
- Greetings, Prince Wuyin.
- Greetings, Prince Wuyin.

37:57.880 --> 37:59.480
Hear the imperial decree!

38:00.000 --> 38:01.520
"By Heaven's will,

38:01.840 --> 38:03.160
I now issue this decree.

38:03.680 --> 38:06.240
My son, Mu Wuyin,

38:06.320 --> 38:07.520
is wise,

38:07.720 --> 38:08.960
known for his virtue,

38:09.120 --> 38:10.440
and loved by the people.

38:11.240 --> 38:12.840
I am old

38:13.040 --> 38:14.280
and no longer have the energy

38:14.600 --> 38:16.760
to carry out the responsibilities
of the throne.

38:17.200 --> 38:18.440
In keeping with ancient custom,

38:18.680 --> 38:20.360
I will step down

38:20.920 --> 38:23.720
and pass the throne to Mu Wuyin.

38:24.640 --> 38:25.480
From today,

38:25.800 --> 38:27.600
I will retire

38:27.680 --> 38:29.040
as Emperor Emeritus.

38:29.560 --> 38:30.760
This decree is issued

38:31.080 --> 38:32.360
for all officials to witness.

38:32.880 --> 38:33.920
Heaven, Earth,

38:34.280 --> 38:36.080
and the gods bear witness."

38:36.320 --> 38:37.440
By imperial order.

39:43.080 --> 39:45.640
Now, do you believe
what I've been telling you?

39:46.560 --> 39:47.560
Thank you for saving me.

39:48.560 --> 39:49.520
I owe you my life.

39:50.000 --> 39:51.240
The capital garrison is already

39:51.400 --> 39:52.840
at the gates of Yujing.

39:53.400 --> 39:54.800
Mu Wuyin's dream

39:54.880 --> 39:56.080
won't last much longer.

39:57.280 --> 39:58.600
Will you join forces with us?

39:59.800 --> 40:02.160
It's not too late to make things right.

40:17.240 --> 40:18.760
Wasn't this supposed to be a wedding?

40:19.240 --> 40:21.080
Why did it turn
into an abdication ceremony?

40:21.560 --> 40:24.400
Why would His Majesty
suddenly give up the throne?

40:25.000 --> 40:26.360
This doesn't make sense.

40:29.040 --> 40:30.400
(Qi Jian, Commander of the Palace Guard)
Silence! Any more outbursts

40:30.960 --> 40:33.080
(Qi Jian, Commander of the Palace Guard)
will be treated as treason!

40:38.960 --> 40:40.800
Begin the coronation.

41:13.840 --> 41:15.520
All officials, kneel!

41:16.520 --> 41:19.200
His Majesty should be
the one reading the edict.

41:19.720 --> 41:21.880
If we kneel,
we're accepting him as the ruler.

41:22.240 --> 41:22.840
That's right.

41:22.920 --> 41:24.320
His Majesty hasn't even shown up!

41:25.360 --> 41:26.320
You're right about that.

41:27.040 --> 41:29.400
Why hasn't His Majesty appeared?

41:34.840 --> 41:35.720
Kneel!

41:52.320 --> 41:53.000
On your knees!

42:01.440 --> 42:03.360
Begin the coronation ceremony!

42:10.840 --> 42:11.440
Wait!

42:23.320 --> 42:24.920
I, Princess Chengping of Beiyuan,

42:25.120 --> 42:27.800
came to congratulate Prince Wuyin
on his succession.

42:28.880 --> 42:31.600
Why does the Qi State greet me
with swords?

42:38.880 --> 42:40.200
Anyone has the right to drive away

42:40.600 --> 42:41.440
a rude guest

42:42.120 --> 42:43.240
who came uninvited.

42:44.360 --> 42:45.880
Prince Wuyin, calm down.

42:47.000 --> 42:48.560
I'm simply confused by something.

42:48.800 --> 42:50.000
If you can explain it,

42:50.080 --> 42:51.160
I'll leave.

42:52.080 --> 42:53.640
After ascending the throne,

42:54.240 --> 42:56.280
are you making this woman your empress?

43:06.160 --> 43:07.840
That's not the daughter
of the Meng family.

43:08.160 --> 43:09.240
Who is she?

43:09.760 --> 43:11.280
Please explain yourself, Prince Wuyin.

43:12.080 --> 43:14.920
She is Empress Lv of Beiyuan.

43:44.000 --> 43:47.200
♪The flower bloomed,
knowing nothing at all♪

43:47.280 --> 43:50.320
♪In splendor, proud and tall♪

43:51.240 --> 43:54.360
♪The flower fell, lashed by the wind♪

43:54.480 --> 43:58.240
♪In a daze,
it felt like lifetimes had thinned♪

43:58.520 --> 44:01.600
♪Petals soaked in rain♪

44:01.720 --> 44:05.040
♪Heartbreak follows again and again♪

44:05.440 --> 44:09.000
♪The flower weeps, burdened by thoughts♪

44:09.080 --> 44:14.800
♪With no one it can be brought♪

44:19.760 --> 44:26.680
♪Wishes struggle through the mire♪

44:27.120 --> 44:33.960
♪Regrets clash in hopeless fire♪

44:34.440 --> 44:41.440
♪Still I hope she'll pick the flower
kissed by dew♪

44:41.760 --> 44:45.800
♪Even if it means this flower♪

44:45.920 --> 44:52.880
♪Will be hers to give to someone new♪

45:04.000 --> 45:07.120
♪Whose eyes
did the flower's heart meet?♪

45:07.200 --> 45:10.440
♪Love and hate held back, discreet♪

45:10.800 --> 45:14.480
♪The flower withers, feelings in decay♪

45:14.600 --> 45:21.160
♪No longer needing to say♪

45:25.240 --> 45:32.160
♪Yet I still long for her in madness♪

45:32.560 --> 45:39.520
♪Unafraid of judgment or sadness♪

45:39.880 --> 45:46.880
♪Remembering the words
she spoke of flowers and skies♪

45:47.240 --> 45:48.920
♪And finding♪

45:49.000 --> 45:56.000
♪They were her gentle heart's reply♪
